      "cooked": "<p>1：Filtering this area to see if it can be adjusted to hide, it takes up too much space when not in use.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/3/b3c3f95276476682c056ba3522bc25daae44bcf7.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b3c3f95276476682c056ba3522bc25daae44bcf7\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/3/b3c3f95276476682c056ba3522bc25daae44bcf7.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"pEhl2B8MsGFg9sUP78SWS7daIOb\" width=\"309\" height=\"255\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">309×255 11.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>2：There is no option to adjust the distance between items, and it is a little too wide.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/5/359ef618f53402d044ab94be607331ecb484709c.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/359ef618f53402d044ab94be607331ecb484709c\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/5/359ef618f53402d044ab94be607331ecb484709c.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"7ElSuPmeehIjze13NIsmtXkp6G0\" width=\"613\" height=\"185\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">613×185 9.41 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Is there an effective workaround? Thank you!</p>",
